<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7400 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7400 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7400 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.7999 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 24		 July 23</p>
<p> High			     75.8500		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.5000		 75.6900</p>
<p> Open			     75.5000		 75.6900</p>
<p> Close			    75.7400		 75.7999</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  1.700		   5.620</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
